---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Publish to and consume from AMQP 0-9-1 (RabbitMQ) exchanges and queues

Usage: rustman amqp [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  produce  Publish messages (a kind: amqp request, or --value flags, or the lines of a piped stdin) with publisher confirms
  consume  Consume messages and print them as they arrive
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help

Examples:
  rustman amqp produce --broker amqp://localhost --exchange orders --routing-key order.created --value '{"id":1}'
  rustman amqp consume --broker amqp://localhost --exchange orders --binding-key 'order.*' --json
  rustman amqp consume --broker amqp://localhost --queue payments --requeue --max-messages 5
